# Fedarchy — Git ignore rules
#
# Scope: this file excludes only genuinely local, generated, or developer-
# specific material. It deliberately does NOT exclude source, shell scripts,
# tests, configuration templates, themes, or runtime resources.
#
# Notably absent: any blanket "*.tar.gz" rule. Fedarchy does not ship
# distributable archives today, but excluding them by extension would risk
# hiding a legitimate future release asset. Backup archives are excluded by
# their specific directory names below instead.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python bytecode and caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test and coverage output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
*.cover
junit*.xml
test-results/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs, scratch, and temporary output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.pid
.cache/
tmp/
scratch/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor and OS artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*~
*.swp
*.swo
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Virtual environments
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local secrets and environment files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
.netrc
.npmrc
.git-credentials
credentials.json
secrets.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local backup snapshots and scratch archives (NOT the project's source).
# Backups live outside the tree by policy (~/Fedarchy-backups/); these rules
# are a safety net in case one is ever created inside it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Fedarchy-backups/
*-backups/
backup/
backups/
*.tar.gz.orig

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Developer-local debris
#
# shell/plugins/.panels/ holds a manual backup of a removed panel plugin
# (cava) and is referenced by no code. Excluded as local scratch.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
shell/plugins/.panels/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS-level Git metadata that must never be committed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes